  "synopsis": "In a chaotic modern world filled with border disputes, ethnic conflicts, and criminal cartels, geopolitical risk consultant Yuri Hatta travels the globe to resolve various crises. From remote regions steeped in superstition to cutting-edge metropolitan cities, Yuri tackles unpredictable disputes that defy common sense. Relying on her sharp intellect, deep knowledge of geopolitics, and occasional pro-wrestling moves, she uncovers the realities of the world—while exploring local and bizarre cuisines along the way.\n\n(Source: MAL News)",
